# Copy this file to .env and fill in your own Supabase project's values
# (Project Settings -> API in the Supabase dashboard). .env is git-ignored —
# never commit real keys. EXPO_PUBLIC_ vars are inlined into the client bundle
# by Metro, which is fine here: the anon key is meant to be public, RLS
# (see supabase/migrations/0001_init.sql) is what actually protects data.